  {
   "id": "turnip-mountain-217203@major-2026-08-01",
   "gameId": "turnip-mountain-217203",
   "displayName": "Update notes for Aug 1 2026",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2026-08-01T13:12:35.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hi all! Lots of bugfixes for the PC version of Turnip! Let's have a look, shall we?",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "The hat machine now guarantees a new hat every time! Sorry about that, that was a nasty bug!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Twin mouse mode fixed and tweaked, especially in the final cutscene!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Intro cutscene now doesn't crash if you skip at a certain part.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Throwing objects could exist forever if you do a frame-perfect grab. No more!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Water currents now persist after pausing and unpausing. Whoops!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "PS5 controllers should work nicely with the game without having to faff around with Steam Input!!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "ps5",
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "The sum of your times is now in the map screen. Fancy!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "That should be it. Jump on the Discord if you find any more bugs!! Cheers all and thank you for playing!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
